m/godotengine/godot/pull/119133.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-01T17:51:06Z"},"body":"Noticed this minor typo in the docs when writing custom property hints for arrays in C#. One of the interpolated values is missing the format specifier after the colon. Likely a basic typo, as every other `elemType` is correctly formatted.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1161\" height=\"264\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61b39962-abe5-4d00-9873-964f0dbd1b1e\" />\r\n\r\n(Context for those unfamiliar with C#, a colon after an interped value specifies a format, and `D` represents decimals or int values. See https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/standard/base-types/standard-numeric-format-strings)\r\n\r\n----------\r\n\r\nBut just to be sure, here's what it looks like if we use the current line without the fix:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"560\" height=\"120\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/02dcd081-e7e6-471a-b83c-a7808e4c6fd0\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"559\" height=\"111\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5a73f30-8916-4d22-b3cd-8402f0294cbd\" />\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119133/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}